{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"A tracker that writes every record to ","type":"text"},{"code":"store","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so records survive the app ending, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whose ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference"},{"text":" start with the ones ","type":"text"},{"code":"store","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" kept from earlier runs.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"init","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"store","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/RecordStore","preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence11RecordStoreP","text":"RecordStore","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"consent","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV","text":"Consent","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enrichers","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV","text":"Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"] = [], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplers","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV","text":"Sampler","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"] = [], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplingSeed","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V","text":"UInt64","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = .random(in: .min ... .max), ","kind":"text"},{"text":"now","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@escaping ","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"@Sendable","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" () -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV","text":"Date","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = { Date.now })","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Where each record is kept until it is delivered."}]}],"name":"store"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The user’s consent, which each event’s category must have before it is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"written and delivered; ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", every event delivered, by default.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"consent"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"What each event’s context gains, applied in order by the tracker’s worker.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"enrichers"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Which events, or groups of events, to keep a fraction of, decided by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s worker after the enrichers and before the store; none by default, so every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event is kept."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"samplers"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The seed the samplers’ decisions come from: fix it and which events are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"kept is fixed too. Drawn from the system’s random number generator once, as the tracker","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is made, by default. Fix it only in tests and replays: every launch with the same seed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"makes the same decision for its first matching event, its second and so on, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fixed seed shipped to every device keeps the same events everywhere rather than the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sampler’s rate of them.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"samplingSeed"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The wall-clock time each event is stamped with when it is tracked. It runs on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracking caller’s thread, so keep it fast."}]}],"name":"now"}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracker’s worker writes each record as it reaches it, before publishing it to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference"},{"text":", rather than a stage reading ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference"},{"text":", which runs in the delivery’s task,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"later, perhaps after a slow batch. Given ","type":"text"},{"code":"consent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", a record is written once its category","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is granted, not while it is held, and the recovered records are gated again. The worker","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"takes the recovered records from ","type":"text"},{"code":"store","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" before anything tracked.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Given ","type":"text"},{"code":"samplers","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", a record they drop is never written. A record the store recovered was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sampled in the run that wrote it, so it isn’t sampled again.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingseed:now:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"init","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"store","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RecordStore","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence11RecordStoreP"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"consent","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Consent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enrichers","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplers","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplingSeed","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UInt64","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"now","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Date","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV5store7consent9enrichers8samplers12samplingSeed3nowACx_AA7ConsentVSgSay6Events8EnricherVGSayAA7SamplerVGs6UInt64V20FoundationEssentials4DateVyYbctc11Persistence11RecordStoreRzlufc","roleHeading":"Initializer","title":"init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Tracker.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L133"}},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Sampler":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","title":"Sampler","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once.","type":"text"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","kind":"symbol","title":"init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker that writes every record to "},{"code":"store","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", so records survive the app ending, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" start with the ones "},{"code":"store","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" kept from earlier runs."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingseed:now:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"store","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ",